<title>FRANCE: TENNIS-KAFELNIKOV POWERS PAST HENMAN.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-KAFELNIKOV POWERS PAST HENMAN.</headline>
<dateline>LYON, France 1996-10-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russian Yevgeny Kafelnikov crushed Tim Henman 6-1 6-3 to reach the Lyon Grand Prix final on Saturday and avenge his Wimbledon elimination by the Briton.</p>
<p>The number two seed reeled off five successive games to wrap up the first set, then stormed ahead in the second after breaking Henman again to go 3-2 up.</p>
<p>Henman, still trying to reach his first ATP Tour final, knocked out the world number five in the first round at Wimbledon and made the quarter-finals.</p>
</text>
